        "original_id": "ad78e6ab-d6e9-5cd6-b624-b45914d1345d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Pinball Wizard\", \"Tommy\", \"Overture\", \"Underture\", \"Sparks\"\n- People: The Who\n- Topics: chart performance, album releases, instrumental tracks\n\nFacts:\n- In May 1969, The Who first released \"Tommy\" as their fourth studio album and as a double album.\n- In 1969, The Who released the original recording of \"Pinball Wizard\" as a single.\n- In 1969, \"Pinball Wizard\" reached No. 4 on the UK charts and No. 19 on the U.S. Billboard Hot 100.\n- \"Overture\" is one of three instrumental tracks on \"Tommy\".\n- The other two instrumental tracks on \"Tommy\" are \"Underture\" and \"Sparks\".\n- \"Overture\" includes some lyrics toward the end despite being one of the instrumental tracks on \"Tommy\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
